{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23510","headline":"题新居寄宣州崔相公 · 白居易","name":"题新居寄宣州崔相公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"门庭有水巷无尘，好称闲官作主人。\n冷似雀罗虽少客，宽於蜗舍足容身。\n疎通竹径将迎月，扫掠莎台欲待春。\n济世料君归未得，南园北曲谩爲邻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23510.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23510","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}